{"id":"05012547-7263-5bfa-9e7c-df970745a011","title":"Rechengesetze bei rationalen Zahlen nutzen","titleEn":"Use arithmetic laws with rational numbers","description":"Die lernende Person kann Rechengesetze bei rationalen Zahlen gezielt einsetzen, um Terme zu vereinfachen, Rechenvorteile zu nutzen und Umformungen zu begründen.","descriptionEn":"The learner can purposefully use arithmetic laws with rational numbers to simplify expressions, exploit calculation advantages, and justify transformations.","requires":["0a6dab2e-1bbb-5587-adb0-456d3991c327"],"tags":["canonical"],"dimensionTags":{"framework":"canonical-gymnasium-math","demandLevel":"AB1","processCompetencies":["K3.1","K4.1"],"guidingIdeas":["L1"],"phase":"J6","area":"Arithmetic","topicCode":"CANONICAL.MATH.SEK1.J6.1H.LAWS"}}
{"id":"09f47964-2cd0-410e-93ee-9632b582fc91","title":"Funktionsbegriff und Darstellungen verstehen","titleEn":"Understand function concept and representations","description":"Die lernende Person kann eine reellwertige Funktion als Zuordnung erklären, die jedem zulässigen Eingabewert genau einen Funktionswert zuweist, und Term, Wertetabelle und Graph einer gegebenen Funktion als zusammengehörige Darstellungen verwenden.","descriptionEn":"The learner can explain a real-valued function as assigning exactly one function value to each permitted input and use the expression, value table, and graph of a given function as corresponding representations.","requires":["71cec9fb-3751-4d61-8b34-c5adbbf6e5f2","2bb4bb91-7929-483a-b735-44275f6b5cdc"],"tags":["GK","LK","canonical"],"dimensionTags":{"framework":"hessen-kc-2024","demandLevel":"AB1","processCompetencies":["K1.1","K4.1"],"guidingIdeas":["L1","L4"],"phase":"E"}}
{"id":"0a6dab2e-1bbb-5587-adb0-456d3991c327","title":"Terme mit rationalen Zahlen strukturiert auswerten","titleEn":"Evaluate expressions with rational numbers in a structured way","description":"Die lernende Person kann die durch Grundrechenarten und Klammern bestimmte Struktur von Termen mit nicht ganzen rationalen Zahlen, insbesondere Brüchen und Dezimalzahlen, erkennen und fachsprachlich beschreiben, diese Terme strukturiert auswerten und die Rechenschritte nachvollziehbar notieren.","descriptionEn":"The learner can recognise and describe in appropriate mathematical language the structure of expressions with non-integer rational numbers, especially fractions and decimals, as determined by basic operations and brackets, evaluate these expressions systematically, and record the calculation steps clearly.","requires":["4eeab7d5-eeb3-579b-845e-1c52ffe9e89f","ee48e811-4c9c-5080-9836-8403fc9f0810"],"tags":["canonical"],"dimensionTags":{"framework":"canonical-gymnasium-math","demandLevel":"AB1","processCompetencies":["K2.1","K3.1","K4.1"],"guidingIdeas":["L1"],"phase":"J6","area":"Arithmetic","topicCode":"CANONICAL.MATH.SEK1.J6.1H"}}
{"id":"11e3cf89-9224-5894-8e4a-ae8ff5af0119","title":"Einfache additive Gleichungen durch Umkehraufgaben lösen","titleEn":"Solve basic additive equations using inverse operations","description":"Die lernende Person kann einfache Gleichungen wie a+x=b, x-a=b oder a-x=b durch Probieren, Rückwärtsarbeiten oder Umkehraufgaben lösen.","descriptionEn":"The learner can solve simple equations such as a+x=b, x-a=b, or a-x=b by trial, backward reasoning, or inverse operations.","requires":["3fde4db5-9e92-5f3a-98e1-d386a42b9e01"],"tags":["canonical"],"dimensionTags":{"framework":"canonical-gymnasium-math","demandLevel":"AB1","processCompetencies":["K2.1","K5.1"],"guidingIdeas":["L1"],"phase":"J5","area":"Arithmetic","topicCode":"CANONICAL.MATH.SEK1.J5.1E"}}
{"id":"13b338eb-f761-5817-9058-11043b9cb253","title":"Messwertänderungen pro Zeitintervall bestimmen","titleEn":"Determine measured changes per time interval","description":"Die lernende Person kann aus zwei tabellierten oder graphisch gegebenen Messwerten die vorzeichenbehaftete Änderung und die zugehörige positive Zeitspanne bestimmen, ihren Quotienten mit Einheit berechnen und als mittlere Änderung pro Zeiteinheit im gewählten Intervall deuten. Sie unterscheidet diesen Wert vom einzelnen Messwert und von Aussagen über jeden Zeitpunkt.","descriptionEn":"The learner can determine the signed change between two measured values given in a table or graph and the corresponding positive elapsed time, calculate their quotient with units, and interpret it as the average change per unit time over the selected interval. They distinguish this value from a single measured value and from claims about every instant.","requires":["4eeab7d5-eeb3-579b-845e-1c52ffe9e89f","ee48e811-4c9c-5080-9836-8403fc9f0810","80c232f1-8f72-5829-9dbe-5a610ccab3be"],"tags":["GK","LK","canonical","SekI","Method","cross-subject:mathematics"],"dimensionTags":{"framework":"canonical-gymnasium-physics","demandLevel":"AB1","processCompetencies":["PK3_MATHEMATISIEREN"],"guidingIdeas":[],"phase":"GLOBAL","area":"Messdaten auswerten","topicCode":"CANONICAL.PHYSICS.METHODS.MEASURED_CHANGE_RATE"}}
{"id":"191c67db-44a8-4f63-994a-d85e8e301194","title":"Rechenvorteile mit Kommutativ- und Assoziativgesetz nutzen","titleEn":"Use arithmetic advantages based on commutative and associative laws","description":"Die lernende Person kann bei Summen und Produkten ganzer Zahlen Rechenvorteile aus Kommutativ- und Assoziativgesetz erkennen, passende Umformungen begründen und unterscheiden, wann diese Gesetze nicht anwendbar sind.","descriptionEn":"The learner can identify calculation advantages from the commutative and associative laws in sums and products of integers, justify suitable rearrangements, and distinguish cases in which these laws do not apply.","requires":["3fde4db5-9e92-5f3a-98e1-d386a42b9e01"],"tags":["canonical"],"dimensionTags":{"framework":"canonical-gymnasium-math","demandLevel":"AB1","processCompetencies":["K2.1","K5.1"],"guidingIdeas":["L1"],"phase":"J5","area":"Arithmetic","topicCode":"CANONICAL.MATH.SEK1.J5.1H"}}
{"id":"1a25ef44-f310-4c23-9ba8-44baec60d3b0","title":"Unbegrenztheit der natürlichen Zahlen mit dem Nachfolgerprinzip begründen","titleEn":"Justify the unboundedness of the natural numbers using the successor principle","description":"Die lernende Person kann begründen, dass es keine größte natürliche Zahl gibt, indem sie zu jeder vorgegebenen natürlichen Zahl eine größere natürliche Zahl angibt und dieses Nachfolgerprinzip verallgemeinert.","descriptionEn":"The learner can justify that there is no greatest natural number by giving a larger natural number for any proposed value and generalising this successor principle.","requires":["624764d6-becd-5f9b-ada3-0d4f9d143073"],"tags":["canonical"],"dimensionTags":{"framework":"canonical-gymnasium-math","demandLevel":"AB1","processCompetencies":["K3.1","K4.1"],"guidingIdeas":["L1"],"phase":"J5","area":"Arithmetic","topicCode":"CANONICAL.MATH.SEK1.J5.1F"}}
{"id":"1e459a1b-4159-5049-84eb-9928129c1610","title":"t-v-Diagramm und Ortsänderung als Fläche","titleEn":"Time-Velocity Graph and Displacement as Area","description":"Die lernende Person kann aus Orts-Zeit-Daten mittlere Intervallgeschwindigkeiten bestimmen, im t-v-Diagramm darstellen und die Ortsänderung als vorzeichenbehaftete Fläche unter dem Graphen deuten.","descriptionEn":"The learner can determine average interval velocities from position-time data, represent them in a time-velocity graph and interpret the displacement as the signed area under the graph.","requires":["971beafa-6ba5-4c82-ac8b-7ebf66eec3dd","13b338eb-f761-5817-9058-11043b9cb253","d6c3fb37-ece6-5b56-9221-1eeb21845877"],"tags":["GK","LK","canonical","cross-subject:mathematics"],"dimensionTags":{"framework":"hessen-kc-2024-physics","demandLevel":"AB1","processCompetencies":[],"guidingIdeas":[],"phase":"E"}}
{"id":"2231c29b-eb4e-51ae-9cb1-eb033bf16099","title":"Parallele und senkrechte Lagebeziehungen erkennen und begründen","titleEn":"Identify and justify parallel and perpendicular relations","description":"Die lernende Person kann bei Strecken und Geraden Parallelität oder Senkrechtlage anhand ihrer geometrischen Bedingungen erkennen, fachsprachlich beschreiben und die Zuordnung unabhängig von Lage oder Ausrichtung begründen.","descriptionEn":"The learner can identify parallel or perpendicular relations between line segments and lines from their geometric conditions, describe them using mathematical language, and justify the classification regardless of position or orientation.","requires":["25593605-5e13-55cc-9a05-8f3d737e15e9"],"tags":["canonical"],"dimensionTags":{"framework":"canonical-gymnasium-math","demandLevel":"AB1","processCompetencies":["K3.1","K4.1"],"guidingIdeas":["L2"],"phase":"J5","area":"Geometry","topicCode":"CANONICAL.MATH.SEK1.J5.2B"}}
{"id":"2331caf2-ccb2-5492-9fc6-48763b848bae","title":"Winkelzeichnungen und Gradmaße ineinander überführen","titleEn":"Translate between angle diagrams and degree measures","description":"Die lernende Person kann bei Winkeln bis 360 Grad mit dem Geodreieck eine gezeichnete Winkelöffnung in ihr Gradmaß und ein vorgegebenes Gradmaß in eine Winkelzeichnung überführen und die jeweilige Winkelart aus der Größe fachsprachlich benennen.","descriptionEn":"The learner can use a protractor, for angles up to 360 degrees, to translate a drawn angle opening into its degree measure and a given degree measure into an angle diagram, and name the corresponding angle type from its measure.","requires":["25593605-5e13-55cc-9a05-8f3d737e15e9"],"tags":["canonical"],"dimensionTags":{"framework":"canonical-gymnasium-math","demandLevel":"AB1","processCompetencies":["K3.1","K4.1"],"guidingIdeas":["L2"],"phase":"J5","area":"Geometry","topicCode":"CANONICAL.MATH.SEK1.J5.2D"}}
{"id":"25593605-5e13-55cc-9a05-8f3d737e15e9","title":"Punktlagen und daraus bestimmte lineare Objekte im Koordinatensystem darstellen","titleEn":"Represent point locations and the linear objects they determine in the coordinate plane","description":"Die lernende Person kann in einem passend skalierten kartesischen Koordinatensystem Punktlagen aus Koordinaten darstellen und daraus vorgegebene Strecken oder Geraden erzeugen, wobei sie die begrenzte beziehungsweise unbegrenzte Ausdehnung begründet.","descriptionEn":"The learner can plot points from coordinates in an appropriately scaled Cartesian coordinate plane and use them to construct specified line segments or lines, explaining their finite or infinite extent.","requires":["65365dce-f33f-49d8-9516-42f75883aa86"],"tags":["canonical"],"dimensionTags":{"framework":"canonical-gymnasium-math","demandLevel":"AB1","processCompetencies":["K3.1","K4.1"],"guidingIdeas":["L2"],"phase":"J5","area":"Geometry","topicCode":"CANONICAL.MATH.SEK1.J5.2A"}}
{"id":"2ae76eae-799c-463e-9ec9-82327f8209a8","title":"Einfache Zählprinzipien in Sachsituationen anwenden","titleEn":"Apply basic counting principles in contextual situations","description":"Die lernende Person kann in einfachen realitätsnahen Situationen Möglichkeiten vollständig und ohne Doppelzählung systematisch erfassen, eine passende Zählstrategie wählen und die ermittelte Anzahl nachvollziehbar begründen.","descriptionEn":"The learner can systematically account for all possibilities in simple real-world situations without double counting, choose a suitable counting strategy, and justify the resulting count clearly.","requires":["cafd6520-c4af-4109-9863-cc49ba6fad4d"],"tags":["canonical"],"dimensionTags":{"framework":"canonical-gymnasium-math","demandLevel":"AB1","processCompetencies":["K2.1","K3.1"],"guidingIdeas":["L1"],"phase":"J5","area":"Arithmetic","topicCode":"CANONICAL.MATH.SEK1.J5.1J"}}
{"id":"2bb4bb91-7929-483a-b735-44275f6b5cdc","title":"Zuordnungen analysieren","titleEn":"Analyze mappings","description":"Die lernende Person kann Zuordnungstabellen erstellen, grafisch darstellen und einfache funktionale Zusammenhänge deuten.","descriptionEn":"The learner can create mapping tables, represent them graphically, and interpret simple functional relationships.","requires":["ca8b2e67-7d14-5baf-8404-26820fe3d548","2f565855-bcd6-4da5-bc80-4b72a2d93d50","b41cb496-dad5-596e-9c23-cdcbdab3ec2e"],"tags":["canonical","modality:visual","representation:graph","tool:geogebra"],"dimensionTags":{"framework":"canonical-gymnasium-math","demandLevel":"AB1","processCompetencies":["K1.1","K4.1"],"guidingIdeas":["L1","L4"],"phase":"GLOBAL","area":"Analysis","topicCode":"CANONICAL.MATH.SEK1.1"}}
{"id":"2f565855-bcd6-4da5-bc80-4b72a2d93d50","title":"Dezimalzahlen auf der Zahlengeraden, im Stellenwertsystem und als Bruch darstellen","titleEn":"Represent decimal numbers on the number line, in place value form, and as fractions","description":"Die lernende Person kann Dezimalzahlen auf einer passend skalierten Zahlengeraden, im Stellenwertsystem und als wertgleichen Bruch darstellen, die entsprechenden Stellen und Anteile zuordnen und begründet zwischen den Darstellungen wechseln.","descriptionEn":"The learner can represent decimal numbers on a suitably scaled number line, in the place-value system, and as equivalent fractions, relate the corresponding places and parts, and justify changes between the representations.","requires":["f6a54a49-b6cf-4ab7-a185-aa08bfcb6c97"],"tags":["canonical"],"dimensionTags":{"framework":"canonical-gymnasium-math","demandLevel":"AB1","processCompetencies":["K3.1","K4.1"],"guidingIdeas":["L1"],"phase":"J6","area":"Arithmetic","topicCode":"CANONICAL.MATH.SEK1.J6.1NI-B"}}
{"id":"3fde4db5-9e92-5f3a-98e1-d386a42b9e01","title":"Ganze Zahlen subtrahieren","titleEn":"Subtract integers","description":"Die lernende Person kann Subtraktionsaufgaben mit ganzen Zahlen sicher lösen, Umkehraufgaben nutzen und Ergebnisse an der Zahlengeraden oder im Sachkontext prüfen.","descriptionEn":"The learner can reliably solve subtraction tasks with integers, use inverse operations, and check results on the number line or in context.","requires":["4b67bed9-06da-40b2-a306-24e9e7dfd390"],"tags":["canonical"],"dimensionTags":{"framework":"canonical-gymnasium-math","demandLevel":"AB1","processCompetencies":["K3.1","K4.1"],"guidingIdeas":["L1"],"phase":"J5","area":"Arithmetic","topicCode":"CANONICAL.MATH.SEK1.J5.1A.SUB"}}
{"id":"4b67bed9-06da-40b2-a306-24e9e7dfd390","title":"Ganze Zahlen addieren","titleEn":"Add integers","description":"Die lernende Person kann Additionsaufgaben mit ganzen Zahlen sicher lösen, Rechenschritte begründen und Ergebnisse an der Zahlengeraden oder im Sachkontext prüfen.","descriptionEn":"The learner can reliably solve addition tasks with integers, justify calculation steps, and check results on the number line or in context.","requires":["d07ef7b1-8bd2-56e0-9e74-d90c3c3e02fe","d825f7ce-e19b-594a-8181-eff199c21d93"],"tags":["canonical"],"dimensionTags":{"framework":"canonical-gymnasium-math","demandLevel":"AB1","processCompetencies":["K3.1","K4.1"],"guidingIdeas":["L1"],"phase":"J5","area":"Arithmetic","topicCode":"CANONICAL.MATH.SEK1.J5.1A"}}
{"id":"4eeab7d5-eeb3-579b-845e-1c52ffe9e89f","title":"Rationale Zahlen addieren und subtrahieren","titleEn":"Add and subtract rational numbers","description":"Die lernende Person kann nicht ganze rationale Zahlen, insbesondere Brüche und Dezimalzahlen, wertgleich in eine für Addition oder Subtraktion geeignete Darstellung überführen, Additionen und Subtraktionen sicher ausführen, dabei Rechenvorteile nutzen und Ergebnisse durch Überschlag plausibilisieren.","descriptionEn":"The learner can transform non-integer rational numbers, especially fractions and decimals, into an equivalent representation suitable for addition or subtraction, carry out additions and subtractions reliably, use advantageous calculation structures, and check results for plausibility by estimation.","requires":["a4c2b831-02f0-5d55-a300-7823a71352c4","5d1decb2-b01b-5c85-88fc-9fc255ff9776"],"tags":["canonical"],"dimensionTags":{"framework":"canonical-gymnasium-math","demandLevel":"AB1","processCompetencies":["K3.1","K4.1"],"guidingIdeas":["L1"],"phase":"J6","area":"Arithmetic","topicCode":"CANONICAL.MATH.SEK1.J6.1E"}}
{"id":"54148506-c23f-41b8-959b-068dd194cf15","title":"Einfache multiplikative Gleichungen unter Bereichsbedingungen lösen","titleEn":"Solve basic multiplicative equations subject to domain conditions","description":"Die lernende Person kann Gleichungen der Formen a·x=b, x:a=b und a:x=b in einem vorgegebenen Zahlenbereich lösen, dabei Null- und Teilbarkeitsbedingungen prüfen, ein geeignetes Verfahren wählen und die Lösung durch Einsetzen kontrollieren.","descriptionEn":"The learner can solve equations of the forms a·x=b, x:a=b, and a:x=b in a specified number domain, check zero and divisibility conditions, choose a suitable method, and verify the solution by substitution.","requires":["cafd6520-c4af-4109-9863-cc49ba6fad4d"],"tags":["canonical"],"dimensionTags":{"framework":"canonical-gymnasium-math","demandLevel":"AB1","processCompetencies":["K2.1","K5.1"],"guidingIdeas":["L1"],"phase":"J5","area":"Arithmetic","topicCode":"CANONICAL.MATH.SEK1.J5.1I"}}

